     1[0m[2m. **[0m[2mDuplicate processing[0m[2m**: Every[0m[2m job is[0m[2m picked up[0m[2m by ALL[0m[2m 5[0m[2m workers.[0m[2m In[0m[2m `de[0m[2mqueue()`,[0m[2m the[0m[2m `await[0m[2m asyncio.sleep[0m[2m(0[0m[2m.01[0m[2m)` creates[0m[2m a window[0m[2m where multiple[0m[2m workers can[0m[2m see[0m[2m the same[0m[2m "[0m[2mpending"[0m[2m job before[0m[2m any[0m[2m worker marks[0m[2m it "[0m[2mprocessing".[0m[2m The status[0m[2m change happens[0m[2m after the[0m[2m await,[0m[2m so multiple[0m[2m cor[0m[2moutines can[0m[2m interleave[0m[2m between[0m[2m finding a[0m[2m pending job[0m[2m and marking[0m[2m it processing[0m[2m.
     
