     Fixes[0m[2m:
     1[0m[2m. In[0m[2m `job[0m[2m_queue.py[0m[2m`,[0m[2m move the[0m[2m status change[0m[2m to "[0m[2mprocessing"[0m[2m BEFORE the[0m[2m `await[0m[2m asyncio.sleep[0m[2m(0[0m[2m.01[0m[2m)` ([0m[2mor remove[0m[2m the sleep[0m[2m).[0m[2m Actually[0m[2m, looking[0m[2m more[0m[2m carefully,[0m[2m the sleep[0m[2m is sim[0m[2mulating some[0m[2m async[0m[2m work[0m[2m during[0m[2m dequeue[0m[2m. The[0m[2m real fix[0m[2m is to[0m[2m mark the[0m[2m job[0m[2m as[0m[2m "[0m[2mprocessing"[0m[2m atomically[0m[2m before any[0m[2m await.[0m[2m So[0m[2m change[0m[2m the[0m[2m order:[0m[2m find[0m[2m pending[0m[2m job,[0m[2m mark it[0m[2m processing,[0m[2m then[0m[2m await.[0m[2m
     
